 "remarks": "Opportunity awaits in this spacious raised ranch located in a desirable neighborhood just minutes from Oak Hills Park Golf Course. Offering a convenient location for commuters with easy access to major roadways, shopping, dining, and area amenities, this home is ready for its next chapter. The property requires TLC and updating throughout but offers great bones, a functional layout, and plenty of potential for buyers looking to renovate and make it their own. Generous living spaces and the classic raised ranch design provide flexibility for additional living, recreation, or home office space on the lower level. Bring your vision and unlock the possibilities in a location that's hard to beat!",
